  1693	async def compress_context_node(state: CanvasRAGState, runtime: Runtime[CanvasRAGConfig]) -> Dict[str, Any]:
  1694	    """
  1695	    Story 2.10: Context compression + mastery injection + learning memory.
  1696	
  1697	    Pipeline position: after check_quality, before faithfulness_check.
  1698	
  1699	    Steps:
  1700	    1. Staleness check on reranked results (non-blocking)
  1701	    2. Compress context from 15K+ tokens to max_tokens (default 3000)
  1702	    3. Build mastery prefix if data available
  1703	    4. Retrieve Graphiti learning memories if available
  1704	
