   127	class RAGService:
   128	    """
   129	    RAG检索服务
   130	
   131	    Story 23.1 Implementation:
   132	    - Wraps canvas_agentic_rag StateGraph
   133	    - Provides async query interface
   134	    - Graceful degradation when LangGraph not available
