  1700	    """
  1701	    # CARD-G4-4: 解析请求作用域并加性透出来源 (X-Vault-Scope-Source 响应头)。
  1702	    # agents 契约不变: vault_id 仍 Optional, 双缺失仍推导 active (G2-2 契约 3,
  1703	    # vault_scope 推导分支自带 warning)。解析结果注入 ContextVar 供下游
  1704	    # memory_service / rag_service 消费, 语义与旧 resolve_vault_group_id 完全一致。
  1705	    _scope = resolve_vault_scope(
